    rdf:value """scheme of an open-air theatre in the Alban Hills would be a failure. It wants great plays - where are they? - and a kind of recitation which the Duse’s realistic talent cannot attain. 
Sunday Nov. 7. 1897.
Bernhard called on Mme. de Montebello at the Gamberaia, and Miss Cruttwell and her friend called on me. I worked a great deal on the lists for the North Italian Painters .
Monday, Nov. 8, 1987 
Mme. de Montebello came to Fiesole and Bernhard showed her the sights. I received a letter from the Gazette des Beaux Arts asking me about a fresco just uncovered at """^^xsd:string ;
